  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Light.PortableResults.AspNetCore.MVC 0.7.0\n      ---------------------------------\n\n      - LightActionResult and LightActionResult<T> and corresponding extension methods to turn result instances into HTTP success responses or RFC 9457 (and RFC 7807) compatible Problem Details responses.\n      - Easy integration into ASP.NET Core's composition root via IServiceCollection.AddPortableResultsForMvc.\n      - OpenAPI attributes and schema-only CLR surrogate types were removed; use Light.PortableResults.AspNetCore.OpenApi for OpenAPI integration.\n      - LightActionResult and LightActionResult<T> now report an unresolvable HttpResultForWriting contract as an\n        InvalidOperationException naming the closed wrapper type. The previous guard was unreachable because\n        JsonSerializerOptions.GetTypeInfo threw a NotSupportedException first. This package remains incompatible\n        with .NET Native AOT.",
